bin/briefing downloads with curl --max-time 60 but wget only gets -T 10 (a per-phase timeout), so a slow server could keep a wget-only machine past the 75 s cold-provision budget. The SessionStart hook timeout (90 s) still bounds it and curl is tried first. Found in the k7 final review (M4). Done: a total bound for the wget path, with a starter test.
